# LS11a: the Azure Flute on Spear Pillar's top step, the stair of light, the Hall of Origin and Arceus's beat
newgame
flag FLAG_GAME_COMPLETED on
pokemon Garchomp 80
give "Azure Flute"
var VAR_HALL_OF_ORIGIN_STATE 1
warp SpearPillar 31 51 down
wait 1
step down 1
answer 0
wait 1.5
shot scn_ls11a_flute_1_stair
wait 0.6
shot scn_ls11a_flute_2_light
read
wait 4.5
shot scn_ls11a_hall_0_foot
step up 17
wait 1.0
shot scn_ls11a_arceus_1_look
wait 1.6
shot scn_ls11a_arceus_2_sign
wait 2.4
shot scn_ls11a_arceus_3_voice
read
wait 4.5
shot scn_ls11a_arceus_4_battle
